<title>FRANCE: Eiffage shares suspended limit-up - SBF.</title>
<headline>Eiffage shares suspended limit-up - SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French public works group Eiffage were suspended limit up at midday on Monday and were scheduled to resume trading at 1025 GMT, a spokesman for the French stockmarkets association SBF said.</p>
<p>Its stock was suspended limit-down twice earlier after the company reported a big first-half loss and suspended its 1996 dividend.</p>
<p>It subsequently predicted a return to profit for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
